-- =====================================================
-- SUSPEND ALL CORTEX SEARCH SERVICES (FOR LATER USE)
-- =====================================================
-- ⚠️  WARNING: This script will suspend ALL Cortex Search services
-- ⚠️  Services will stop consuming SERVING credits but become unqueryable
-- ⚠️  Only run this if you want to completely stop serving costs
--
-- Expected Impact: 90%+ reduction in AI services costs (from ~117 credits/day to ~0)
-- Use Case: Emergency cost reduction or when demos are not needed for extended periods
-- 
-- To resume services later, change "SUSPENDED" to "RUNNING" in individual ALTER statements
-- =====================================================

